    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "100,000 for 4 acres (25,000 per acre and 7500 per 4 acre plot (For Fencing and Admin) 16 Acres Available.\n\nThese ideally located agricultural plots offer an excellent opportunity to acquire approximately 4 to 16 acres of land in a peaceful and scenic setting on the outskirts of Mullingar.\n\nTucked away just off the N4 and close to the shores of Lough Sheever, the lands enjoy a secluded countryside setting while remaining remarkably convenient to Mullingar town centre. Right-of-way access is provided, with Mullingar town centre and the Regional Hospital Mullingar approximately 3km away.\n\nThe lands offer considerable versatility and may appeal to purchasers seeking additional agricultural ground, a hobby farm, grazing or horticultural land, recreational space or a manageable parcel of land for a variety of agricultural uses. With plots ranging from approximately 4 acres available, purchasers have the opportunity to select an area suited to their individual requirements.\n\nThe location is further enhanced by its proximity to both Lough Sheever and Lough Owel, together with a wide selection of sporting and recreational amenities. Tullaghan Pitch & Putt, Mullingar Rugby Club, equestrian facilities and a golf academy are all nearby, while schools, shops and the extensive range of amenities available in Mullingar are within easy reach.\n\nConvenient access to the N4 provides excellent connectivity to Mullingar and the wider road network, while essential services are available in the surrounding area.\n\nOffering an increasingly rare combination of manageable agricultural acreage, privacy and exceptional convenience to Mullingar, these plots represent an attractive opportunity for agricultural, horticultural, recreational or investment purposes.\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n•Agricultural plots ranging from approximately 4 to 16 acres \n•Plots available individually depending on purchaser requirements \n•Prime location on the outskirts of Mullingar \n•Approx. 3km from Mullingar town centre \n•Peaceful and secluded countryside setting \n•Right-of-way access \n•Convenient access to the N4 \n•Close to schools and everyday amenities \n•Convenient to sporting and leisure facilities \n•Close to Tullaghan Pitch & Putt \n•Convenient to Mullingar Rugby Club \n•Equestrian facilities and golf academy nearby \n•Suitable for a variety of agricultural and recreational uses \n•4-16 acres available\n•Lake shore Slevins Lake\n\nIdeal For\n•Hobby farming \n•Grazing and livestock \n•Free-range farming \n•Organic farming \n•Vegetable and herb growing \n•Orchard or soft-fruit cultivation \n•Small-scale crop production \n•Personal food production \n•Recreational use \n•Additional agricultural land \n•Community-supported agriculture \n•Potential agri-tourism uses, subject to any necessary consents \n•Long-term land investment \n•Fishing\n•Walking trails\n•Possible woodland walks\n•National heritage area\n•Special area of Conservation\n•Wild life sanctuary possibilities\n•Ideal land for breeding wildlife and game.\n•Lots of natural flora and fauna ideal for ground nesting birds.\n•Ideal natural area for nature therapy."
      },
